---
---
<section id="about" class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-[#090D16] text-white relative overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-800">
  <!-- YC-style Subtle Tech Grid Lines Background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#1e293b_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#1e293b_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:4rem_4rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)] opacity-20 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Ambient Glows -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[700px] h-[350px] bg-brand-emerald/10 blur-[140px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- YC Startup Badge Header -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6 mb-20">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700/80 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider shadow-inner">
        <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-emerald animate-pulse"></span>
        BUILDING THE FUTURE OF F&B AI INFRASTRUCTURE
      </div>
      
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.1]">
        Mengganti Tiket Kertas Resto dengan <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 via-teal-300 to-amber-300">Voice Intelligence & RAG.</span>
      </h2>
      
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed">
        ServePoint memelopori infrastruktur suara meja di Indonesia. Kami mengubah setiap meja makan menjadi terminal pemesanan yang memahami dialek lokal, catatan alergi kustom, hingga perhitungan gizi kalori secara presisi.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- YC Metric Highlights Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-20">
      <div class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-2xl space-y-1">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase">Processing Latency</div>
        <div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white font-mono">&lt; 300ms</div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-emerald-400 font-semibold">Real-Time Edge Voice AI</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-2xl space-y-1">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase">Accuracy Rate</div>
        <div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-emerald font-mono">99.8%</div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-semibold">Bahasa & Dialek Lokal</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-2xl space-y-1">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase">Active Outlets</div>
        <div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white font-mono">150+</div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-amber-400 font-semibold">Cafe & Restaurant Outlets</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-2xl space-y-1">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase">System Uptime</div>
        <div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-teal-300 font-mono">99.99%</div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-semibold">Enterprise Local Sync Backup</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Architecture & Core Pillars Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16">
      
      <!-- Pillar 1: Custom RAG Engine -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-950 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 space-y-4 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
        <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm">
          01
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Custom RAG Architecture</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Admin restoran tidak perlu melakukan retraining AI. Cukup *drag & drop* file Excel/PDF gizi dan resep, RAG Engine ServePoint langsung melakukan enkapsulasi data secara instan.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-xs text-slate-400 space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 font-mono">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
            Zero-code Data Ingestion
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
            Custom Response Flow Policy
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2: Nutrition Transparency for Fitness -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-950 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 space-y-4 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
        <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm">
          02
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Nutritional Intelligence</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Memberdayakan segmen pelanggan gym, runner, dan pencinta hidup sehat. AI mampu mengurai Protein (g), Kalori (kcal), dan Karbohidrat dari menu resto secara transparan di meja.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-xs text-slate-400 space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 font-mono">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
            Real-time Macro Calculation
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
            Allergen & Diet Safety Filters
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3: Offline-First Local Sync -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-950 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 space-y-4 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
        <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm">
          03
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Offline-First Edge Sync</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Operasional restoran tidak boleh terhenti saat koneksi internet mati. Sistem ServePoint beroperasi secara *local intranet fallback* untuk terus mengirimkan tiket order ke dapur.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-xs text-slate-400 space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 font-mono">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
            Local POS & Printer Fallback
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
            Automatic Cloud Reconciliation
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Engineering & Founding Vision Banner -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8">
      <div class="space-y-3 text-left max-w-2xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-emerald uppercase tracking-wider">ENGINEERING PHILOSOPHY</span>
        <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Dirancang Khusus untuk Karakteristik F&B Indonesia</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Kami memadukan riset bahasa lokal dengan arsitektur sistem kasir yang tangguh. Hasilnya adalah asisten meja yang ramah, cepat, dan membuat outlet resto Anda lebih menguntungkan.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a 
        href="/contact" 
        class="shrink-0 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-emerald hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105"
      >
        Hubungi Tim Enginnering &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
